{"file":"Privacy.dc.html","data":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Privacy Policy — Zendt</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Zendt privacy policy — how we collect, use, and protect your information.\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/logo-transparent.png\" type=\"image/png\">\n<script src=\"/support.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<x-dc>\n<helmet>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://api.fontshare.com/v2/css?f[]=clash-display@400,500,600,700&display=swap\">\n  <style>\n    body { margin: 0; background: #0A0A0A; }\n    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }\n    a:hover { opacity: 0.75; }\n  </style>\n</helmet>\n\n<div style=\"background:#0A0A0A; color:#F5F5F5; font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif; min-height:100vh;\">\n  <nav style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px; padding:16px clamp(20px,5vw,48px); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\">\n    <a href=\"/\" style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px; font-family:'Clash Display',sans-serif; font-weight:600; font-size:20px; letter-spacing:-0.02em;\">\n      <img src=\"/logo-transparent.png\" alt=\"Zendt\" style=\"width:34px; height:34px; display:block; object-fit:contain;\">\n      Zendt\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"/\" style=\"font-size:14px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6); font-weight:500;\">← Back to home</a>\n  </nav>\n\n  <main style=\"max-width:760px; margin:0 auto; padding:clamp(48px,10vw,80px) clamp(16px,4vw,24px) 100px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif; font-size:12px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4); letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:16px;\">Legal</div>\n    <h1 style=\"font-family:'Clash Display',sans-serif; font-size:38px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-0.02em; margin:0 0 12px;\">Privacy Policy</h1>\n    \n    <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:36px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.75; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\">\n      <section>\n        <h2 style=\"font-family:'Clash Display',sans-serif; font-size:19px; font-weight:700; color:#F5F5F5; margin:0 0 10px;\">1. Overview</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin:0;\">Zendt is a registered Indian software company. This policy explains what information we collect through our invoicing and income-tracking software, how we use it, and the choices you have.</p>\n      </section>\n      <section>\n        <h2 style=\"font-family:'Clash Display',sans-serif; font-size:19px; font-weight:700; color:#F5F5F5; margin:0 0 10px;\">2. Information We Collect</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin:0;\">We collect account information you provide (such as your name, email, and business details), invoice and client data you enter into the software, and basic usage data (like device and browser information) that helps us maintain and improve the Service.</p>\n      </section>\n      <section>\n        <h2 style=\"font-family:'Clash Display',sans-serif; font-size:19px; font-weight:700; color:#F5F5F5; margin:0 0 10px;\">3. How We Use Information</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin:0;\">We use this information to operate the Service — creating and displaying your invoices, generating your income dashboard, keeping your account secure, responding to support requests, and communicating important product updates.</p>\n      </section>\n      <section>\n        <h2 style=\"font-family:'Clash Display',sans-serif; font-size:19px; font-weight:700; color:#F5F5F5; margin:0 0 10px;\">4. How We Share Information</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin:0;\">We do not sell your data. We may share limited information with service providers who help us run the Service (such as hosting and email delivery), and only to the extent needed for them to perform that work. We may also disclose information if required by law.</p>\n      </section>\n      <section>\n        <h2 style=\"font-family:'Clash Display',sans-serif; font-size:19px; font-weight:700; color:#F5F5F5; margin:0 0 10px;\">5. Data Storage &amp; Security</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin:0;\">We use reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect the information stored in the Service. No system is completely secure, and we encourage you to use a strong, unique password for your account.</p>\n      </section>\n      <section>\n        <h2 style=\"font-family:'Clash Display',sans-serif; font-size:19px; font-weight:700; color:#F5F5F5; margin:0 0 10px;\">6. Your Choices</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin:0;\">You can access, update, or delete most of your account and invoice information directly within the software. You may also contact us to request a copy of your data or ask us to delete your account.</p>\n      </section>\n      <section>\n        <h2 style=\"font-family:'Clash Display',sans-serif; font-size:19px; font-weight:700; color:#F5F5F5; margin:0 0 10px;\">7. Cookies</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin:0;\">We use cookies and similar technologies to keep you signed in and to understand how the Service is used, so we can improve it over time.</p>\n      </section>\n      <section>\n        <h2 style=\"font-family:'Clash Display',sans-serif; font-size:19px; font-weight:700; color:#F5F5F5; margin:0 0 10px;\">8. Changes to This Policy</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin:0;\">We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We'll post any changes here with a new \"Last updated\" date.</p>\n      </section>\n      <section>\n        <h2 style=\"font-family:'Clash Display',sans-serif; font-size:19px; font-weight:700; color:#F5F5F5; margin:0 0 10px;\">9. Contact</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin:0;\">Questions about this policy or your data can be sent to <a href=\"mailto:hello@zendt.in\" style=\"color:#F5F5F5; text-decoration:underline;\">hello@zendt.in</a>.</p>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer style=\"padding:32px clamp(20px,5vw,48px); border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:13px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\">© 2026 Zendt</span>\n    <div style=\"display:flex; gap:20px;\">\n      <a href=\"/terms\" style=\"font-size:13px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\">Terms</a>\n      <a href=\"/privacy\" style=\"font-size:13px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\">Privacy</a>\n      <a href=\"/refund\" style=\"font-size:13px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\">Refund</a>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n</div>\n\n</x-dc>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}